      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLAZING EARLY (1) produced a moderate effort last time when fifth at this track over 520m behind Boom Town (30.72) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Rates on top in this line up. GUS THE GREAT (3) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around Townsville over 498m in 28.57, claiming a Grade 5/6 by 3 lengths. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Leading player again. FEDERAL JOKER (7) filled a minor placing last start at Q Lakeside behind Rusty Aces (19.95) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. VICTORY EXAM (4) has won at this course and distance, cannot be underestimated.",
